{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國家航空航天局（NASA）的旅行者1號（Voyager 1）探測器於2026年11月18日抵達一個前所未有的裏程碑：它與地球之間的距離達到一個光日（Light-Day），即光在24小時內能夠傳播的距離。這也是人類製造的航天器首次抵達這一距離。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586960.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:06.330008+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:16:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:21.312566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:21.312566+00:00","content_hash":"4498aa8ce7475825554c25054e4e0c0f6367458ea8287b4166013ca31e45dce3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}